    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're back again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this (completely necessary) third (and final?) installment in the Five Nights at Roner's series, you control Nick - a paranormal investigator who's managed to land himself in the middle of a town-wide scandal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harboring the culprit of the town's biggest news in years, by day, you'll scavenge the town for work and information, and by night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, the paycheck comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooki<strong>er<i>er.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scari<strong>er<i>er.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retarded<strong>er<i>er.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817940/extras/e6700fe27697565297c5eaeddcd0b176.avif?t=1751334170\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong>\u00a0from the nightmares that taunt you through the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong> your office to keep them at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE</strong>\u00a0who you befriend and betray in RPG-like, text-based day sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIDE</strong> the fate of Maplestown Heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive? Or will Roner add another ghost to his roster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five days. Five Nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Times ticking, Nick.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Don't let me down.</strong></i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They're back again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this (completely necessary) third (and final?) installment in the Five Nights at Roner's series, you control Nick - a paranormal investigator who's managed to land himself in the middle of a town-wide scandal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harboring the culprit of the town's biggest news in years, by day, you'll scavenge the town for work and information, and by night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, the paycheck comes at a price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spooki<strong>er<i>er.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scari<strong>er<i>er.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retarded<strong>er<i>er.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3817940/extras/e6700fe27697565297c5eaeddcd0b176.avif?t=1751334170\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND</strong>\u00a0from the nightmares that taunt you through the screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UPGRADE</strong> your office to keep them at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE</strong>\u00a0who you befriend and betray in RPG-like, text-based day sections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DECIDE</strong> the fate of Maplestown Heights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive? Or will Roner add another ghost to his roster?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five days. Five Nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Times ticking, Nick.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Don't let me down.</strong></i></p>",
